stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Unauthenticated : App Load
    Unauthenticated --> Authenticated : POST /auth/login (JWT issued)
    Authenticated --> Dashboard : Route to /dashboard
    Dashboard --> ROE_Pending : Select scenario
    ROE_Pending --> Provisioning : Acknowledge ROE
    Provisioning --> Readiness_Check : docker compose up profile
    Readiness_Check --> Active_Session : All health checks pass
    Readiness_Check --> Provisioning : Retry (timeout)
    Active_Session --> Red_Workspace : Student role = red
    Active_Session --> Blue_Workspace : Student role = blue
    Red_Workspace --> Active_Session : Switch role
    Blue_Workspace --> Active_Session : Switch role
    Red_Workspace --> Phase_Recon : Begin Recon
    Phase_Recon --> Phase_Scanning : Notes documented
    Phase_Scanning --> Phase_Exploit : Scan findings noted
    Phase_Exploit --> Phase_PostExploit : Flag captured
    Phase_PostExploit --> Debrief_Pending : Session complete
    Blue_Workspace --> Debrief_Pending : Session complete
    Debrief_Pending --> Debrief_View : Report generated
    Debrief_View --> Dashboard : Start new session
    Active_Session --> Session_Error : Container failure
    Session_Error --> Provisioning : Auto-recovery
    Authenticated --> Unauthenticated : Logout / Token expiry
    note right of Provisioning: docker compose --profile scXX up -d
    note right of Readiness_Check: /api/health/readiness polls\nPostgres + Redis + Elasticsearch
    note right of Phase_Exploit: Gatekeeper blocks exploitation\nif recon notes are empty
